phase Guarding the flock

  step start: operator sends Start Sheep Guard Mission
    note: Launch: flight to the safe area, then the orchestrator activates Sheep Guard.
    then soi.mc is Deployed
    then soi.orch is Sheep Guard Active
    then soi.ap is Following Watch Path
    then soi.sg is Patrol Route, Sheep Counting
    then soi.pd is Predator Watch
